    <span xml:lang="en-US" lang="en-US" itemprop="description" data-careersite-propertyid="description" class="rtltextaligneligible">
                <span class="jobdescription"><p>Requisition No: 846772 </p>

<p>Agency: Florida Board of Governors</p>

<p>Working Title: Oracle Application Developer - 48003829</p>

<p> Pay Plan: SES</p>

<p>Position Number: 48003829 </p>

<p>Salary:  $85,000 - $90,000 </p>

<p>Posting Closing Date: 08/12/2025 </p>

<p><b>Total Compensation Estimator </b><u><b><a href="https://compcalculator.myflorida.com/" target="_blank" title="Total Compensation Estimator">Tool</a></b></u></p>
<p><span style="font-size:11.0pt"><span><span style="font-family:&#39;Calibri&#39;, sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&#39;Utopia Std&#39;, serif"><img src="data:image/png;base64," style="width:374.0px;height:107.0px"></span></span></span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:11.0pt"><span><span style="font-family:&#39;Calibri&#39;, sans-serif"><span style="font-size:26.0pt"><span style="font-family:&#39;Utopia Std&#39;, serif"><span style="color:#2e74b5"><span>Oracle Application Developer, Information Technology and Security (03829)</span></span></span></span><b> </b></span></span></span></p>

<table align="left" cellspacing="0" class="MsoTableGrid" style="border:none;margin-left:9.0px;margin-right:9.0px;width:727.0px">
	<tbody>
		<tr>
			<td style="height:186.0px;padding:0.0in 7.0px 0.0in 7.0px;width:727.0px" valign="top">
			<p><span style="font-size:11.0pt"><span><span style="font-family:&#39;Calibri&#39;, sans-serif"><b><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&#39;Utopia Std&#39;, serif"><span style="color:black">The Florida Board of Governors is seeking a qualified candidate for the position of Oracle Application Developer within the Information Technology and Security (ITS) Department.  As an Oracle Application Developer, you will be a part of the ITS Application Development Team that primarily develops and supports web-based applications using the ORACLE database and ORACLE Application Express (APEX) as the front end.</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p>

			<p><span style="font-size:11.0pt"><span><span style="font-family:&#39;Calibri&#39;, sans-serif"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&#39;Utopia Std&#39;, serif"><span style="color:black">       Responsibilities, duties, and activities may include, but are not limited to, the following:</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<ul>
				<li><span style="font-size:11.0pt"><span><span style="font-family:&#39;Calibri&#39;, sans-serif"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&#39;Utopia Std&#39;, serif">Integrate with a team of developers from a wide range of experience and backgrounds.</span></span></span></span></span></li>
				<li><span style="font-size:11.0pt"><span><span style="font-family:&#39;Calibri&#39;, sans-serif"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&#39;Utopia Std&#39;, serif">Interface and coordinate with contracted ITS where applicable.</span></span></span></span></span></li>
